@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] secrets-outside-store
The NixOS module MUST accept service secrets through a runtime environment-file path and MUST NOT serialize those secrets into the Nix store.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:testing] service-machine-test
The NixOS machine test MUST boot the service, verify authenticated and unauthenticated HTTP behavior, verify durable state, and verify service restart behavior.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:cli] service-cli-on-path
Enabling `services.underclass` MUST add its configured package to the host's system packages. With the default package, this exposes `underclass` and `utop` on PATH.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] service-monitor-socket
The service MUST create a Unix monitor socket at `/run/underclass/monitor.sock` that local users can connect to without a token; network admin endpoints MUST retain token authentication.
